line 3: `theme` must be facile
line 4: `size` must be WIDTHxHEIGHT in pixels, each from 16 to 16384
line 5: unknown key `colour`
line 6: duplicate key `title`
line 7: `step_duration` must be a number of seconds above 0
line 13: `layout` must be one of default, cover, center, split, raw
line 14: `steps` must be a whole number from 0 to 999
line 15: `duration` must be a number of seconds above 0
line 16: `theme` belongs to the headmatter, not to a scene
line 17: `class` must be class names made of letters, digits, - and _
